831
00:42:21.830 --> 00:42:23.499
[Lelaki] Ya, sila kembali.
Jom jalan ni

832
00:42:23.582 --> 00:42:24.583
[Pendakwa Lee] I.C.

833
00:42:24.667 --> 00:42:26.001
menghantar, berlepas

834
00:42:29.171 --> 00:42:30.422
